# Normalize the whole repo to LF on checkout.
#
# Cassette recordings (tests/cassettes/**/*.yaml) are byte-sensitive: the
# replay harness splits interactions on "\n---\n" and validates the scrubbed
# YAML form, so a CRLF checkout (Windows autocrlf) breaks replay. Keep every
# text file LF, matching upstream CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary test fixtures.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.epub binary
